member.returns:
true if item was successfully removed from the ExpiringHashtable;
otherwise, false. This method also returns false if item is not found in the
original ExpiringHashtable.

member.example:
LinkedHashtable linkedHashtable = new LinkedHashtable();
linkedHashtable["blah"] = new ArrayList();
linkedHashtable.AddLink("blah2", "blah");
linkedHashtable["blah"].Equals(linkedHashtable["blah2"]) //returns true;
linkedHashtable.Values.Count == 1 //returns true;

LinkedHashtable linkedHashtable = new LinkedHashtable();
